  "description": "For the little’uns that aren’t so little any more. Its lightweight and durable with the aluminium frame. Designed to bridge the gap between younger and older kids bikes, this next-step frame is perfect for those slightly bigger adventures – whether it’s treasure-hunting with their friends or flying through the streets on the school run. The only thing you have to worry about is trying to keep up. Designed specifically for kids aged 6-9 years old, or 114cm-129cm, the 20-inch Pop is guaranteed to get your kid outside and glued to the pedals. Its sturdy frame and chunky tyres means it can withstand even the biggest adventure, and with six gears to choose from, the fun doesn’t stop. For more detailed size breakdown and tips for measuring your child, check out our kids bike size guide.",
